# Webstrike Elite (3/3 reach, {G}{G}): cast from two Forests on turn 3 it can block Bot2's attacking Ornithopter (flying 0/2) on
# turn 4 and kills it; the Elite takes no damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Webstrike Elite
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
